  "prefLabel": "Ph 103.04 Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 103.04 Meetings.\n\n(a) The board shall meet in its office on the third Wednesday of each month. Special meetings shall be held at the call of the president or by any officer.\n\n(b) A majority of the board may take action by telephone poll or written ballot provided that such action is ratified at a subsequent meeting of the board.\n\nSource. #6181-A, eff 2-5-96",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
